"""Ledger E claims from Battles and Leaders vol. 3 for units the state volumes do not cover (Confederate Johnson, Pickett, Semmes, Wofford,
Stuart's cavalry, the Second Corps reserve artillery) and for Buford's approach. BL3 articles are secondary non-lead sources written
after the war: BY HENRY J. HUNT (Union chief of artillery; The First Day at Gettysburg BL3-S028, The Second Day BL3-S030), BY JAMES
LONGSTREET (Lee's Invasion of Pennsylvania BL3-S027; Lee's Right Wing at Gettysburg BL3-S034), BY J. B. KERSHAW (BL3-S033; the index puts
Kershaw's article under the heading DEVIL'S DEN). No author is an officer of the unit he writes about except where stated, so every
claim is tier inferred. Full articles read at the cited passages 2026-10-30."""
import sys, os
sys.path.insert(0, os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__)))
from positions_E_lib import add

